    "summary": "Implemented LLD-e0821209d94791d0-s1 in vscode-plugin/src/chat/chat-panel.ts: added the #insrc-newchat icon button (bubble-plus inline SVG in the .pico slot) left of .histchip in .chrome .right with .newchatbtn chip-matching CSS, wired its click to stopPropagation + newChatPick(nc), and removed the trailing new… row from renderHistoryMenu. The new-chat message payload is byte-identical, so host/store/protocol are untouched. Updated the two pinning tests in chat-panel.test.ts and the three chat-shell.test.ts cases that exercised the removed row. Gates: chat-panel+chat-shell 275/275, cli-adapter 106/106, extension-chat-wiring 26/26, tsc --noEmit clean. Code committed as f636a30c0 with the Insrc-Story trailer.",
